/strong></p>\n                <p>\n                    - Must meet Canadian presence requirements<br>\n                    - Subject to CIRA policies and dispute resolution rules<br>\n                    - Registration may be suspended or transferred under policy enforcement\n                </p>\n                <p><strong>.DE / .ES Domains</strong></p>\n                <p>\n                    - Governed by national registry rules (Germany / Spain)<br>\n                    - Subject to local courts and dispute policies\n                </p>\n                <p><strong>.CO Domains</strong></p>\n                <p>\n                    - Governed by Colombian registry law<br>\n                    - Disputes handled under UDRP and Colombian jurisdiction\n                </p>\n                <h3>8. Generic gTLD Registry Rules (Applicable Where Relevant)</h3>\n                <p>Some domains (e.g. .CLUB, .BUZZ, .LONDON, .ONLINE, .SITE, .STORE, etc.) may include:</p>\n                <p>\n                    - Registry right to suspend, delete, or transfer domains at discretion for: Abuse prevention, Legal compliance, Payment issues, Security and stability protection<br>\n                    - Mandatory indemnification of registry and registrar against claims<br>\n                    - Compliance with Acceptable Use Policies (AUP)<br>\n                    - Anti-abuse rules (no phishing, malware, spam, or infringement)\n                </p>\n                <h3>9. Registry Authority Clause</h3>\n                <p>CloudHost247 Isc. and its registry partners reserve the right to:</p>\n                <p>\n                    - Correct registration errors<br>\n                    - Suspend or transfer domains in disputes<br>\n                    - Enforce ICANN and registry policies<br>\n                    - Comply with legal or government orders\n                </p>\n                <h3>10. Acceptance</h3>\n                <p>By registering a domain through CloudHost247 Isc., the Registrant:</p>\n                <p>\n                    - Confirms acceptance of all applicable registry rules<br>\n                    - Agrees to dispute resolution processes<br>\n                    - Accepts responsibility for accurate registration data<br>\n                    - Acknowledges that violation may result in suspension or loss of domain rights\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>";

